{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のタイトルは\n伊織とある話しをしてる時に\n伊織からでてきた言葉です！(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グッときました！(*´꒳`*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいい！伊織らしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は早朝から\n雷の音がすごくて怖かった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨が降ってるのは気づかなかったんだけど、\n雷にはびっくり！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家の周りに出てみたら\nいろいろなものが道路に流れ着いてて\n驚きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの、うさぎの置物と\nサッカーボールはどこのお家のだろう。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしのお家は、家の周りに置物とかは\n置いてないので何もながれなかったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、やっと明日\n携帯の画面変えられるかも！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直せたらいいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バキバキでみえない～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/02/4947370/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/02/4947370/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおりさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/02/4947370/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は伊織と下町とか観光地を\nフラフラしようと約束してたけど\n昼間は雨が降ってたので\n夕方から夢の国にいってきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終始楽しかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織といるのがすごく楽しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでも話しちゃうし、\nなんでも聞いてくれるし\n乃木坂入って1番最初に遊んだのも\n伊織なんだよ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて遊んだ日のことは\n謝っても謝りきれません。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまの関係性であんなことしたら\n一生口きかない！って怒りそう( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなこと言って、\nすぐ話してくれるんだろうけど♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん笑って叫んで\n久しぶりに息抜きができて\n楽しかったよ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週からツアーが再開するし\n気を引き締めてがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/02/4947370/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/02/4947370/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暗闇で\nインカメのフラッシュで